WEBVTT

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:30.386
We also have to ask ourselves:

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.596
How do we work?

00:03:31.620 --> 00:03:37.870
Why is the place I live here,
and work is far away?

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:43.716
We need to rethink cities
around the four guiding principles

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:48.259
that are the key building blocks
of the 15-minute city.

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:53.502
First, ecology: for a green
and sustainable city.

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:56.826
Second, proximity:

00:03:56.850 --> 00:04:01.629
to live with reduced distance
to other activities.